{"id":"9f83e5a1d0632c23","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-equationminorbound.md","title":"Column compression preserves a violated equation in at most two-to-m variables","display":"thm-equationminorbound — Column compression preserves a violated equation in at most two-to-m variables","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-equationminorbound","aliases":["27-thm-equationminorbound"],"display":"thm-equationminorbound — Column compression preserves a violated equation in at most two-to-m variables","depends_on":["[[27-df-functionalequation]]","[[27-df-variableidentification]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§11.5 Theorem 11.16 proof","source_printed_pages":"504","source_pdf_pages":"528","verification_status":"source-column-compression-construction-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-equationminorbound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-equationminorbound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-equationminorbound — Column compression preserves a violated equation in at most two-to-m variables"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"599d9af24f7e091a\" href=\"?note=599d9af24f7e091a\" title=\"27-df-functionalequation\">27-df-functionalequation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7b29c798e40853c1\" href=\"?note=7b29c798e40853c1\" title=\"27-df-variableidentification\">27-df-variableidentification</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.5 Theorem 11.16 proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"504"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"528"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-column-compression-construction-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}\">\\(e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(e)=m\">\\(\\nu(e)=m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m\">\\(Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{e,n}(g,Y)\\ne R_{e,n}(g,Y)\">\\(L_{e,n}(g,Y)\\ne R_{e,n}(g,Y)\\)</span>。方程求值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599d9af24f7e091a\" href=\"?note=599d9af24f7e091a\" title=\"27-df-functionalequation\">27-df-functionalequation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q},\\mathrm{Id}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q},\\mathrm{Id}_r\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7b29c798e40853c1\" href=\"?note=7b29c798e40853c1\" title=\"27-df-variableidentification\">27-df-variableidentification</a>。列向量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\">\\(C_i\\)</span>、列型数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>、合法编号集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_Y\">\\(\\mathcal R_Y\\)</span> 及各编号对应的压缩赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y^{(r)}\">\\(Y^{(r)}\\)</span> 由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_i\\coloneqq(Y_{1i},\\ldots,Y_{mi})\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad q\\coloneqq|\\{C_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_i\\coloneqq(Y_{1i},\\ldots,Y_{mi})\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad q\\coloneqq|\\{C_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_Y\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q}\\mid\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(r(i)=r(j)\\Longleftrightarrow C_i=C_j)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_Y\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q}\\mid\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(r(i)=r(j)\\Longleftrightarrow C_i=C_j)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"1\\le q\\le\\min\\{n,2^m\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_Y\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[1\\le q\\le\\min\\{n,2^m\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_Y\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Y^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\left(\\{(r(i),Y_{ai})\\mid i\\in[n]\\}\\right)_{a\\in[m]}\\quad(r\\in\\mathcal R_Y),\\qquad Y^{(r)}\\in(\\mathbb B^q)^m\\quad(r\\in\\mathcal R_Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Y^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\left(\\{(r(i),Y_{ai})\\mid i\\in[n]\\}\\right)_{a\\in[m]}\\quad(r\\in\\mathcal R_Y),\\qquad Y^{(r)}\\in(\\mathbb B^q)^m\\quad(r\\in\\mathcal R_Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Y\\;L_{e,q}(\\mathrm{Id}_r(g),Y^{(r)})\\ne R_{e,q}(\\mathrm{Id}_r(g),Y^{(r)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Y\\;L_{e,q}(\\mathrm{Id}_r(g),Y^{(r)})\\ne R_{e,q}(\\mathrm{Id}_r(g),Y^{(r)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文提供的来源信息为 Theorem 11.16 的列压缩证明。相同列上的任意逐坐标布尔表达式值相同，所以同编号坐标给出相同值；满射编号保证每个压缩坐标都有值，故所构造的函数图确实单值且全定义。复制压缩向量恢复原输入，每次函数调用保持，违反方程的状态亦保持。这里给出所有合法列型编号，不依赖未说明的代表列选择。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-functionalequation","status":"resolved","id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-functionalequation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-variableidentification","status":"resolved","id":"7b29c798e40853c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-variableidentification]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-functionalequation","status":"resolved","id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}$、$\\nu(e)=m$，$g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$ 且 $L_{e,n}(g,Y)\\ne R_{e,n}(g,Y)$。方程求值见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]；$\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q},\\mathrm{Id}_r$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]。列向量 $C_i$、列型数 $q$、合法编号集合 $\\mathcal R_Y$ 及各编号对应的压缩赋值 $Y^{(r)}$ 由下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-variableidentification","status":"resolved","id":"7b29c798e40853c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}$、$\\nu(e)=m$，$g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$ 且 $L_{e,n}(g,Y)\\ne R_{e,n}(g,Y)$。方程求值见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]；$\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q},\\mathrm{Id}_r$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]。列向量 $C_i$、列型数 $q$、合法编号集合 $\\mathcal R_Y$ 及各编号对应的压缩赋值 $Y^{(r)}$ 由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(e)=m","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m","display":false},{"tex":"L_{e,n}(g,Y)\\ne R_{e,n}(g,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q},\\mathrm{Id}_r","display":false},{"tex":"C_i","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y^{(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"C_i\\coloneqq(Y_{1i},\\ldots,Y_{mi})\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad q\\coloneqq|\\{C_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\}|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_Y\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q}\\mid\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(r(i)=r(j)\\Longleftrightarrow C_i=C_j)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"1\\le q\\le\\min\\{n,2^m\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_Y\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"Y^{(r)}\\coloneqq\\left(\\{(r(i),Y_{ai})\\mid i\\in[n]\\}\\right)_{a\\in[m]}\\quad(r\\in\\mathcal R_Y),\\qquad Y^{(r)}\\in(\\mathbb B^q)^m\\quad(r\\in\\mathcal R_Y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in\\mathcal R_Y\\;L_{e,q}(\\mathrm{Id}_r(g),Y^{(r)})\\ne R_{e,q}(\\mathrm{Id}_r(g),Y^{(r)}).","display":true}],"bytes":2271,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-equationminorbound|thm-equationminorbound — Column compression preserves a violated equation in at most two-to-m variables]]"}],"outgoing":["599d9af24f7e091a","7b29c798e40853c1"]}